      "ActivityOtherHealthServices": false,
      "ActivityPersuitPurposesDescription": "Our charity s programs are dedicated to rescuing and supporting animals while assisting vulnerable members of our community. Through our foster program, we rescue, rehabilitate, and rehome special needs animals that might otherwise face euthanasia. Our mobile vet clinic provides fear-free, tailored veterinary care, particularly for anxious pets, helping guardians keep and care for their animals rather than surrendering them due to behavioural challenges. Additionally, our outreach programs support those in crisis, including terminally ill individuals, people at risk of homelessness, women escaping domestic violence, and communities affected by natural disasters, ensuring pets remain with their families during difficult times.",
